//the path of buy without queue
        Request
             ↓
        Discount
             ↓
        DB Save
             ↓
        Generate Invoice
             ↓
        Send Email
             ↓
        Notification
             ↓
        Response

//the path of buy with queue

        Request
             ↓
        Discount
             ↓
        DB Save
             ↓
        Response

    in parallel:

        Generate Invoice
        Send Email
        Send Notification